    h1 NASA Media Contacts
    text The newsroom at NASA Headquarters in Washington is open from 8 a.m. to 6 p.m. Eastern Monday through Friday. Please email only one media contact listed below for your inquiry. If unsure where to direct your inquiry, please email the newsroom at: hq-media@mail.nasa.gov.
